## Verification Plan

### Automated / Semi-Automated
- Start the server — confirm `file_registry` collection is created in MongoDB.
- Drop `bus_routes_v2` collection and restart — verify all files in `data/raw/` are re-ingested cleanly with no duplicates.
- Add a new CSV file to `data/raw/` and restart — verify only the new file is ingested.
- Modify an existing CSV and restart — verify old chunks are deleted and new ones are ingested.

### Manual API Tests
- `POST /query/stream` with a route question → should route to `rag`.
- `POST /query/stream` with "hello" → should route to `general_llm`.
- `POST /chatbot/stream?message=...` → should still work (backward compat).
- After adding a test tool, `POST /query/stream` with a tool-triggering question → should route to `tool`.

