## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1**: The current `/chatbot/stream` endpoint accepts `message` as a **query parameter** (`?message=...`). The new `/query/stream` will accept a **JSON body**. Do you want to also update `/chatbot/stream` to accept a JSON body, or keep it as-is for backward compatibility with the frontend?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2**: For the **intent classifier**, do you want it to use a fast local LLM call (adds ~100–300ms latency per request) or a **keyword/rule-based classifier** (instant, but less intelligent)? Recommended: LLM-based for accuracy, rule-based as fallback.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q3**: Do you have any **existing tools** in mind (e.g., a fare calculator, live bus tracking API, booking system) that should be registered first? Or should the tool registry be set up empty and ready for future addition?
